WEBVTT

01:48.541 --> 01:49.875
Repeat after me.

01:49.916 --> 01:51.708
Three times one equals three.

01:52.041 --> 01:55.375
Three times one equals three.

01:55.375 --> 01:57.458
Three times two equals six.

01:57.500 --> 02:00.833
Three times two equals six.

02:01.125 --> 02:02.958
Three times three equals nine.

02:03.000 --> 02:06.566
Three times three equals nine.

02:29.041 --> 02:31.166
- Who's that?
- Who are you?

02:31.296 --> 02:32.419
Why are you here?!

02:33.666 --> 02:34.750
I'm Phuc.

02:35.458 --> 02:36.875
This is my house.

02:40.583 --> 02:41.666
What's your name?

02:42.375 --> 02:43.583
I'm Su.

02:43.750 --> 02:45.416
Why are you not in class?
Why are you here?

02:45.875 --> 02:47.541
It's summer time.

02:47.833 --> 02:49.838
Summer is all about having fun,
not studying.

03:03.333 --> 03:04.458
Oh, Su...

03:04.958 --> 03:07.625
Don't tell anyone that you
see me here today.

03:07.833 --> 03:09.583
And I won't tell anyone that...

03:09.833 --> 03:11.208
you skipped class today.

03:13.166 --> 03:14.250
Okay?

03:24.411 --> 03:26.744
What happened to you?

03:38.083 --> 03:40.583
This scar reminds me
that I once had friends.

03:42.791 --> 03:44.000
When I was in seventh grade,

03:44.076 --> 03:47.076
my father sent me to live with my
grandfather in Ha Lam town.

03:47.299 --> 03:52.375
ONCE UPON A LOVE STORY

03:59.416 --> 04:00.625
Students! Stand up!

04:01.291 --> 04:04.875
Good morning, teacher!

04:05.458 --> 04:07.250
- Come in.
- Yes.

04:08.420 --> 04:09.875
[September 1987]

04:09.916 --> 04:10.958
Sit down.

04:12.208 --> 04:14.166
You should get a haircut.

04:18.666 --> 04:20.791
Well, you may introduce yourself
to everyone now.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.916
I'm Phuc.

04:24.208 --> 04:25.666
My house is in Go Rua.

04:25.916 --> 04:27.791
My grandfather is Master Duong.

04:27.875 --> 04:29.250
My father is Bay Chuoc.

04:29.416 --> 04:31.958
You can sit next to class monitor, Vinh.

04:32.166 --> 04:33.333
Yes ma'am.

04:33.541 --> 04:35.000
Duy, please give him your seat.

04:37.958 --> 04:39.791
Let's take our books out
for the new lesson.

04:46.541 --> 04:48.458
Hey Mien, my pen is clogged,

04:48.583 --> 04:49.875
please give me a hair.

04:59.875 --> 05:02.333
And that day I also knew
that Skinny Vinh liked Mien.

05:04.250 --> 05:06.416
I myself don't understand since when

05:06.625 --> 05:08.916
and why I care about Mien.

05:12.208 --> 05:13.458
Hey Mien!

05:14.500 --> 05:15.541
Sister!

05:18.250 --> 05:19.750
Duong bought you a gift.

05:20.916 --> 05:22.208
Thank you Duong.

05:26.458 --> 05:27.583
Let's go.

05:34.333 --> 05:36.708
Hey, Duong is taking Lua
for a "talk" at the stream.

05:36.750 --> 05:38.958
- Duong... My dear Duong...
- Bathing in the stream, my dear!

05:39.000 --> 05:41.250
Duong.. Oh my Duong...

05:42.583 --> 05:45.083
My dear Duong...

05:49.125 --> 05:50.625
My dear Duong...

05:53.916 --> 05:54.958
Hey.

05:55.208 --> 05:57.708
Why do you keep acting like her servant?

05:57.750 --> 06:00.125
You boys are so proud to bully a girl?

06:00.166 --> 06:03.166
You wanna be her
knight in the shining armor?

06:03.250 --> 06:04.750
Let's teach him a lesson.

06:04.750 --> 06:05.833
Come on!

06:13.916 --> 06:16.162
How dare you?

06:26.500 --> 06:27.500
Hey Phuc!

06:27.708 --> 06:28.708
Thank you.

06:29.041 --> 06:30.041
You saved me.

06:30.857 --> 06:31.899
It's nothing.

06:32.458 --> 06:34.083
I just followed what my father told me.

06:35.000 --> 06:36.625
Did your dad teach you to fight?

06:38.458 --> 06:39.666
My father told me

06:39.833 --> 06:40.916
that in life,

06:41.208 --> 06:43.041
the most important thing is being fearless.

06:45.666 --> 06:47.416
Why do they call you Skinny Vinh?

06:48.041 --> 06:49.500
Because I'm skinny.

06:49.958 --> 06:51.041
What's your nickname?

06:51.500 --> 06:52.583
I don't have one.

06:52.750 --> 06:55.250
- It's just Phuc.
- Then I'll call you Phuc Shrimp Tail.

06:56.125 --> 06:57.208
But why?

06:58.000 --> 07:00.145
You have a shrimp tail on
the back of your head.

07:02.000 --> 07:03.000
Where?

07:03.416 --> 07:04.416
- I don't see it!
- Here.

07:06.916 --> 07:08.754
It's nothing, it's hair!

07:09.458 --> 07:11.000
Are you delirious from the beating?

07:16.333 --> 07:17.708
That was the first time

07:18.041 --> 07:19.958
Vinh and Phuc were punished because of me.

07:22.041 --> 07:23.291
But before that

07:23.625 --> 07:25.458
Vinh was beaten many times because of me.

07:25.535 --> 07:27.267
There was Le, then Cu em,

07:27.616 --> 07:29.314
then my brother Huong.

07:33.750 --> 07:35.750
I'm back from school.

07:35.875 --> 07:36.958
Why do you look so sad?

07:37.166 --> 07:39.083
- He bullied you, right?
- No, it's not like that.

07:39.125 --> 07:40.833
- Hey!
- That's not true!

07:41.000 --> 07:44.166
Let's bring the wine home quickly
or dad's gonna yell at us.

07:47.423 --> 07:48.465
Let's go.

07:53.678 --> 07:56.375
Half of my soul was lost when you left,

07:57.078 --> 08:00.250
The remaining half turned foolishly bereft.

08:02.041 --> 08:03.166
What's with your face?

08:04.458 --> 08:05.583
I'm okay.

08:06.041 --> 08:08.166
- I'm home, grandma.
- Hi dear.

08:08.500 --> 08:09.583
Full topping?

08:11.000 --> 08:13.875
I have forbidden to hang around
with that tramp.

08:15.958 --> 08:17.375
All these drawings...

08:17.541 --> 08:18.833
Drawing?

08:18.916 --> 08:19.958
End it right away!

08:20.166 --> 08:21.333
You hear me?

08:21.416 --> 08:22.958
- Huh?
- Stop beating her, please.

08:23.500 --> 08:24.666
You don't answer?!

08:24.666 --> 08:25.750
You don't answer,

08:25.750 --> 08:27.083
you don't answer?!

08:27.666 --> 08:29.833
Why are you so stubborn?!

08:29.875 --> 08:32.681
Why are you so damn stubborn?!

08:33.625 --> 08:36.750
Pray with your parents,
then show me your face.

08:48.875 --> 08:51.750
Oh my gosh,
your face is completely bruised.

08:54.958 --> 08:57.132
- Please bear with me a little.
- All right, grandma.

08:58.333 --> 08:59.416
This looks like

08:59.708 --> 09:01.666
you were beaten up
with no chance to fight back.

09:02.750 --> 09:03.875
Who hit you?

09:04.041 --> 09:06.500
Tell me, I'll scold his parents.

09:06.916 --> 09:08.083
It's okay, grandma.

09:08.791 --> 09:10.958
He fought over the youngest
child of Sau Thoi's family.

09:11.125 --> 09:13.666
- Huh?
- I...

09:14.291 --> 09:15.375
I didn't.

09:15.458 --> 09:17.916
Oh my gosh, there's nothing to deny.

09:18.333 --> 09:20.291
Being beaten because of a girl you like

09:20.625 --> 09:22.625
is worth it kiddo! Be proud!

09:22.708 --> 09:24.083
Worthy of nonsense!

09:24.333 --> 09:25.791
You can't even care for yourself,

09:25.958 --> 09:27.791
hang around all day doing nothing.

09:28.083 --> 09:30.458
No wonder there's no
girl willing to marry you.

09:31.291 --> 09:33.875
It seems like I don't
fit in here or something.

09:33.916 --> 09:35.291
What are you talking about? Huh?

09:37.125 --> 09:38.333
Oh my gosh!

09:40.666 --> 09:44.708
I love you because I hate sadness

09:45.125 --> 09:49.083
I love you because I hate anger

09:49.541 --> 09:51.375
Love you...

09:53.583 --> 09:54.708
Have a seat.

09:59.250 --> 10:00.500
- Uncle.
- Huh?

10:01.000 --> 10:04.125
I think your ex-girlfriends
are so beautiful.

10:04.500 --> 10:07.416
Why don't you marry a girl so
grandmother won't scold you anymore?

10:08.791 --> 10:10.666
If our fate is over,
what can I do about it?

10:16.541 --> 10:18.083
Loving someone is not enough.

10:19.541 --> 10:20.708
There needs to be fate too

10:21.333 --> 10:22.682
then we can be husband and wife.

10:23.916 --> 10:25.506
Fate?

10:39.166 --> 10:40.291
Sister!

10:41.166 --> 10:42.208
Have some food.

10:42.916 --> 10:44.250
Bring it inside.

10:44.666 --> 10:45.875
I'm not hungry.

10:46.416 --> 10:47.708
How can you be not hungry?

10:48.666 --> 10:51.458
You haven't eaten anything all day.

10:52.583 --> 10:53.916
Have a bite, please.

11:10.333 --> 11:11.416
But...

11:12.375 --> 11:13.916
Why don't you love another man

11:14.833 --> 11:16.166
so dad won't scold you anymore?

11:20.916 --> 11:22.166
You can't just...

11:25.458 --> 11:27.416
love anyone like that.

11:30.083 --> 11:31.125
But...

11:32.583 --> 11:34.125
Dad said Duong is a
useless man with no job,

11:35.750 --> 11:37.250
and his ex-wife left him,

11:39.416 --> 11:40.583
Dad worries...

11:43.416 --> 11:44.458
in the end,

11:45.708 --> 11:47.000
you will suffer.

11:52.666 --> 11:53.875
If in this life

11:59.708 --> 12:01.375
I can't marry Duong, then...

12:11.750 --> 12:12.958
It's dad's truck!

12:16.958 --> 12:18.958
Hey hey! Phuc! Phuc!

12:20.125 --> 12:21.235
Daddy!

12:26.916 --> 12:27.958
Watch out!

12:31.625 --> 12:32.708
Hey,

12:32.750 --> 12:34.958
corn harvest time is coming in a few days.

12:35.250 --> 12:36.500
Here's yours, grandpa.

12:36.750 --> 12:39.750
Stay home to help Sau Thoi this time.

12:40.166 --> 12:41.958
No need to call more people.

12:43.416 --> 12:45.416
- I'll leave early tomorrow morning.
- Take me with you!

12:45.666 --> 12:46.791
Where do you think you're going?

12:46.833 --> 12:47.916
Stay home and go to school.

12:49.089 --> 12:50.089
Look.

12:51.375 --> 12:54.812
Is this town not good enough
for your business,

12:55.041 --> 12:56.916
that you have to take it elsewhere?

12:57.391 --> 12:59.516
Only when you settle down
can you have a decent career.

12:59.541 --> 13:01.666
But if you're on the road all year round,

13:01.666 --> 13:03.736
sooner or later something will happen.

13:06.958 --> 13:08.458
Then who will take care of him?

13:10.041 --> 13:11.666
If you don't think for yourself,

13:11.791 --> 13:13.458
then at least be considerate of others.

13:14.125 --> 13:15.750
Set an example for your son.

13:15.791 --> 13:18.625
He's already getting into fights at school.

13:19.208 --> 13:22.333
Then when he grows up,
what else will he become?

13:22.391 --> 13:23.249
Huh?

14:07.208 --> 14:08.291
Shrimp Tail!

14:18.458 --> 14:21.000
Hey, your guava tree has a lot of fruits.

14:22.250 --> 14:23.458
Obviously.

14:25.583 --> 14:27.041
- Pick that one.
- Which one?

14:27.041 --> 14:28.053
On your left.

14:44.038 --> 14:45.163
Steering wheel...

14:45.416 --> 14:46.708
- Hey!
- Huh?

14:46.750 --> 14:48.166
Have you ever held a steering wheel?

14:50.141 --> 14:51.183
Nope.

14:51.250 --> 14:53.041
Just the other day I got to
try out that steering wheel.

14:53.125 --> 14:54.875
It felt so good!

14:55.333 --> 14:56.375
But my dad said
that when I grow up,

14:56.416 --> 14:59.041
he'd teach me how
to drive a real truck.

14:59.875 --> 15:01.375
That's amazing!

15:01.375 --> 15:04.500
He was on a long trip once
and he took me with him.

15:05.041 --> 15:07.208
Whenever we felt sleepy,
we went to the cafe to sleep.

15:07.333 --> 15:10.250
But the good thing is that in the cafe,
my dad knows everyone.

15:10.625 --> 15:14.250
At that time, I was so happy
that I could sleep alone in a room.

15:18.291 --> 15:19.708
So where did your father sleep?

15:20.583 --> 15:24.166
He said he was worried that
his snore would keep me up,

15:24.375 --> 15:26.333
so he slept with
the shop owner lady next door.

15:26.791 --> 15:28.000
Wow!

15:32.750 --> 15:36.458
There's no pride in showing off
those indecent stories.

15:36.666 --> 15:37.708
Hello sir.

15:39.791 --> 15:44.125
Why are there books scattered
all over the ground?

15:47.166 --> 15:50.000
If you don't know how to love
or care for books,

15:50.000 --> 15:52.083
then you're not allowed to read
them anymore, you hear me?

15:52.083 --> 15:53.125
Yes.

15:53.708 --> 15:55.583
Put it back where you found it.

16:07.958 --> 16:09.791
Hey, can you sit down?
It's so hard to ride.

16:10.166 --> 16:12.208
My butt hurt when I sit,
I'll just stand.

16:13.375 --> 16:14.644
Try harder!

16:16.666 --> 16:19.041
Stop!

16:19.083 --> 16:20.250
Get down!

16:20.750 --> 16:21.875
Let's go.

16:26.166 --> 16:27.416
I will kill you!

16:27.458 --> 16:29.000
Seducing my daughter?

16:29.166 --> 16:30.958
You seduced my daughter!

16:31.041 --> 16:32.708
You seduced my daughter!

16:33.333 --> 16:35.208
- Stop!
- You seduced my daughter!

16:35.416 --> 16:36.458
Come on!

16:36.458 --> 16:38.208
- You keep talking about this!
- Hey!

16:38.250 --> 16:39.500
Damn you!

16:39.583 --> 16:40.666
How dare you run from me?

16:40.708 --> 16:43.583
You locked your daughter at home already,
why do you still beat him?

16:43.583 --> 16:45.375
You are not allowed near Lua, you hear me?

16:47.041 --> 16:48.416
I'll kill you.

16:49.083 --> 16:51.083
What's the matter?

16:51.250 --> 16:52.833
- Cool down, please!
- Get out of the way!

16:52.875 --> 16:54.666
Take it easy! I beg you! Please!

16:55.541 --> 16:57.125
- What kind of daughter is she?
- Hey!

16:57.166 --> 16:58.750
- Our family face is tainted.
- Hey!

16:59.541 --> 17:01.208
I'll kill you!

17:02.833 --> 17:04.916
- Are you happy now?
- I'm begging you!

17:05.000 --> 17:06.166
Oh my gosh, Lua!

17:06.208 --> 17:09.000
- Lua! Lua!
- Sister!

17:09.333 --> 17:10.666
- Lua!
- Lua!

17:14.541 --> 17:16.125
Stop crying, okay?

17:16.583 --> 17:17.708
Don't worry.

17:18.250 --> 17:22.226
Let her come help me for a while
and she will be happy again.

17:22.291 --> 17:24.166
At this age, things are quickly forgotten.

17:24.791 --> 17:25.833
Okay?

17:26.750 --> 17:28.500
Rest assured, both of you.

17:29.666 --> 17:30.708
Okay.

17:30.875 --> 17:33.333
Please help me, help her.

17:33.416 --> 17:34.875
Rest assured, okay?

17:38.598 --> 17:39.598
I'm leaving.

18:13.708 --> 18:15.541
Let's go to the station. It's late.

18:16.118 --> 18:17.070
Sis!

18:27.458 --> 18:28.666
Sis!

18:50.328 --> 18:51.453
Shoot!

18:51.750 --> 18:53.000
Got her!

19:00.416 --> 19:01.666
She bolted!

19:02.714 --> 19:05.464
Being the knight again, Skinny Vinh?

19:06.375 --> 19:08.207
- Who did you just bump into?
- Right!

19:09.083 --> 19:11.125
- What did you just do?
- Who made her cry?

19:11.548 --> 19:12.715
Vinh!

19:13.750 --> 19:15.500
Brother! Come on!

19:16.466 --> 19:18.632
Come on!

19:18.708 --> 19:21.083
- You watch out for me.
- Okay, let's go home.

19:24.773 --> 19:25.856
Let's go!

19:29.115 --> 19:30.865
- Come on.
- Let's go.

19:37.791 --> 19:39.426
Have you looked carefully, Huong?

19:43.995 --> 19:46.166
Come on dude, let's go home.

19:46.250 --> 19:47.291
Quiet!

19:47.416 --> 19:49.416
I told you I fell.

19:49.625 --> 19:50.750
Don't lie.

19:51.041 --> 19:53.916
Well... I had a fight with Huong.

19:54.625 --> 19:55.958
You fought with Huong?

19:56.458 --> 19:57.708
More like he beat you up.

19:58.458 --> 19:59.791
But why didn't you dare hit him?

20:01.375 --> 20:02.916
Or is it because you like Mien,

20:03.000 --> 20:04.166
so you didn't dare to act?

20:04.291 --> 20:06.333
Well... I...

20:06.666 --> 20:08.000
If you don't dare to, let me!

20:13.250 --> 20:14.333
Who is that?

20:14.583 --> 20:15.958
Come fight me if you dare.

20:22.038 --> 20:24.001
- Stop!
- Why do you scream? Run.

20:24.320 --> 20:25.261
I'll kill you.

20:27.695 --> 20:29.324
Get low! He'll see us.

20:42.125 --> 20:43.375
Run! He's coming!

20:47.822 --> 20:49.031
Sit down.

20:58.500 --> 20:59.708
If I find out who you are

20:59.868 --> 21:01.350
you'd be dead for sure, you hear me?

21:01.440 --> 21:02.799
Shh! Sit still!

21:19.818 --> 21:20.818
You OK?

21:21.458 --> 21:22.625
I'm okay.

21:32.034 --> 21:33.791
It's ready.
Let's eat over there, it's cooler.

21:41.208 --> 21:42.500
- Oh my!
- Be careful, it's hot.

21:42.754 --> 21:43.754
Yummy!

21:44.408 --> 21:45.782
You really like Mien, don't you?

21:47.481 --> 21:48.690
I don't know.

21:48.774 --> 21:50.232
To hell with your "I don't know".

21:50.375 --> 21:51.791
You must like her very much

21:52.041 --> 21:53.637
to be the punching bag
for her brother.

21:55.125 --> 21:56.596
I really don't know.

21:57.208 --> 21:59.254
- But I only see...
- What do you see?

22:00.750 --> 22:03.083
Fire! Fire! Fire!

22:09.126 --> 22:10.209
Grab the bag!

22:56.458 --> 22:57.750
C'mon man...

22:57.916 --> 22:59.208
Let's go home.

22:59.458 --> 23:02.166
Nah, grandpa'd kill me if I come home.

23:08.291 --> 23:09.958
Go home!

23:11.606 --> 23:12.898
Remember what I said?

23:13.309 --> 23:15.018
The most important thing is
not to be afraid.

23:26.833 --> 23:28.500
- Hey Skinny Vinh.
- Huh?

23:29.092 --> 23:31.092
I find Mien extremely boring.

23:31.541 --> 23:33.416
She always looks so gloomy.

23:33.786 --> 23:35.453
I have never seen her smile.

23:36.732 --> 23:37.774
Well...

23:38.500 --> 23:39.791
So why do you like her?

23:42.125 --> 23:43.708
I don't know either.

23:44.788 --> 23:45.788
Hey!

23:46.166 --> 23:47.625
But what is it like to like someone?

23:49.083 --> 23:52.333
Like... Just like how you feel for Mien!

23:55.208 --> 23:57.916
What does that mean?

24:01.566 --> 24:04.108
Hey, do you want to be her husband?

24:04.458 --> 24:06.041
What in the world are you saying?

24:08.308 --> 24:10.000
What if someone heard?

24:10.041 --> 24:11.375
Who's gonna listen here?

24:11.625 --> 24:14.083
Do you think you will marry her?

24:14.583 --> 24:17.583
Then later on, maybe
you have children together,

24:18.375 --> 24:19.791
then when it's time to eat,

24:19.875 --> 24:21.208
you kids will go

24:21.833 --> 24:24.583
"Dad, dad, come eat, dad!"

24:25.125 --> 24:27.708
That's it, you have to think carefully.

24:28.041 --> 24:30.208
If you want to be her husband,

24:30.416 --> 24:32.000
that means you really really like her.

24:32.083 --> 24:34.166
Then you've got to tell her so, understand?

24:35.315 --> 24:36.606
But...

24:37.041 --> 24:38.416
Uncle Huan told me that

24:39.000 --> 24:41.708
whether a couple can become
husband and wife depends on their fate…

24:42.190 --> 24:45.565
What does he know? He's not married,
yet he's preaching you fate.

24:54.225 --> 24:55.225
Vinh!

24:55.838 --> 24:56.838
Phuc!

24:57.708 --> 24:59.583
- Oh Vinh!
- Oh Phuc, Phuc!

24:59.708 --> 25:01.875
- Oh Vinh! Vinh!
- Phuc!

25:02.916 --> 25:04.083
Phuc!

25:05.125 --> 25:06.625
There they are!

25:06.666 --> 25:07.958
- Right?
- On that rocky shore.

25:08.000 --> 25:10.500
- That's right, Phuc and Vinh.
- We've been looking for them all night!

25:10.500 --> 25:11.583
It hurts!

25:18.375 --> 25:20.000
Because of a girl,

25:20.625 --> 25:21.916
you got beaten up,

25:22.375 --> 25:23.833
then got burnt,

25:25.083 --> 25:26.625
looks like you like her a lot?

25:26.833 --> 25:29.416
Do you think Mien knows?

25:31.416 --> 25:33.416
How could she not know?

25:36.102 --> 25:38.602
So what should I do now?

25:39.125 --> 25:40.583
Nothing.

25:42.087 --> 25:44.456
Love grows naturally.

25:45.427 --> 25:47.677
You just have to be her friend
like you have always been.

25:48.250 --> 25:49.458
Friendship

25:49.666 --> 25:51.208
is the most suitable soil

25:51.541 --> 25:53.750
for love to sow its seeds.

25:54.309 --> 25:55.434
One day,

25:56.250 --> 25:58.250
you will receive the most precious reward.

25:59.403 --> 26:01.176
- Precious?
- Right.

26:01.825 --> 26:04.000
What reward uncle?

26:06.375 --> 26:07.583
What else can it be?

26:10.000 --> 26:12.083
The reward for love

26:14.031 --> 26:16.114
is love itself!

26:33.250 --> 26:34.416
Your father is on this side,

26:35.083 --> 26:36.416
and your grandfather is here,

26:37.375 --> 26:38.666
so when you die

26:38.916 --> 26:40.291
you will be on the other side.

26:44.333 --> 26:45.416
Yeah.

26:45.744 --> 26:46.827
That's right.

26:47.250 --> 26:48.791
Oh, are you afraid of death?

26:52.697 --> 26:54.572
Who lives in this world
without fear of death?

26:56.391 --> 26:57.641
Are you scared?

27:00.097 --> 27:01.280
Then what are you afraid of?

27:02.208 --> 27:03.410
I'm afraid of growing up.

27:04.000 --> 27:05.458
Growing up like you...

27:06.958 --> 27:10.000
my grandparents and parents will grow old.

27:11.583 --> 27:13.166
Then everyone will die.

27:14.541 --> 27:16.083
Growing up is not fun at all.

27:16.666 --> 27:18.208
I just want to be a kid.

27:27.583 --> 27:29.625
But everyone has to grow up, Su.

27:31.366 --> 27:36.266
[September 1992]

27:43.208 --> 27:44.958
[New School Year 1992 - 1993]

27:47.725 --> 27:48.850
What do we have this afternoon?

27:48.875 --> 27:50.333
It's the first day, Phuc.

27:52.500 --> 27:55.041
- It's fine. When am I not like that?
- Grade 12 already!

27:55.458 --> 27:56.750
Don't scare me.

28:22.500 --> 28:23.750
You're so in love!

28:24.041 --> 28:25.500
Come to the playground if you dare.

28:25.583 --> 28:27.833
Oh my gosh, he acts like I'm afraid of him!

28:27.958 --> 28:29.125
Do you think I'm afraid of you two?

28:29.125 --> 28:30.458
- Come on then!
- Come on!

28:30.958 --> 28:32.083
Pass it up!

28:33.208 --> 28:37.657
Phuc, come on! Phuc, come on!

28:40.826 --> 28:42.076
Vinh, come on!

28:44.169 --> 28:46.175
Vinh, come on!

29:26.750 --> 29:28.458
Mien! Mien!

29:33.024 --> 29:35.315
It's the weekend, you should
come over to hang out.

29:37.083 --> 29:38.250
Vinh will be there, too.

29:39.103 --> 29:41.333
My grandpa just brought
home a new box of books.

29:41.375 --> 29:42.750
It's very nice! Isn't that right?

29:43.250 --> 29:44.708
Uh... Yes.

29:45.375 --> 29:47.125
Phuc's house has many good books.

29:47.208 --> 29:48.458
You should come visit someday.

29:48.500 --> 29:50.580
Let's make "someday" tomorrow.

29:50.875 --> 29:52.458
My grandpa will be at the commune tomorrow

29:52.500 --> 29:54.208
to hold an Elderly Association
meeting until evening.

29:54.375 --> 29:56.166
We can play freely.

29:56.497 --> 29:57.539
Okay?

29:57.936 --> 29:59.811
Sure.

30:00.108 --> 30:01.150
See you tomorrow.

30:10.054 --> 30:11.054
Hey!

30:11.329 --> 30:13.114
What are you planning, Shrimp Tail?

30:14.750 --> 30:16.416
You passed the ball for me to score,

30:17.232 --> 30:18.690
now I pass it back to you.

30:18.779 --> 30:20.029
What are you talking about?

30:20.638 --> 30:22.041
How long are you going to wait?

30:22.538 --> 30:23.621
Wait for what?

30:23.875 --> 30:25.541
Confessing your love to Mien of course.

30:28.085 --> 30:29.710
We're in Grade 12 now,

30:29.750 --> 30:31.125
if you don't move fast,

30:31.295 --> 30:32.711
then you'll never get a chance.

30:33.125 --> 30:35.916
But... But I don't know

30:36.156 --> 30:37.322
how to confess.

30:37.791 --> 30:39.791
It must be terribly embarrassing!

30:40.375 --> 30:41.541
What to be embarrassed about?

30:41.583 --> 30:42.708
Let me show you.

30:42.958 --> 30:44.208
You just...

30:45.886 --> 30:47.219
look straight into her eyes.

30:47.458 --> 30:48.875
Then you slowly...

30:50.726 --> 30:52.809
Hey! Bad boy! Bad boy!

31:10.569 --> 31:11.652
Mien!

31:19.125 --> 31:22.625
The current cinema stars, Le Cong Tuan Anh,
Le Hong Thuy Tien, Le Tuan Anh,

31:23.000 --> 31:26.791
will definitely bring
romantic love scenes to you.

31:27.208 --> 31:31.041
Please come and enjoy the movie at the
Community Center this Sunday night.

31:31.125 --> 31:33.583
One night only!

31:41.083 --> 31:42.791
Phuc! Phuc!

31:50.676 --> 31:52.176
Are you going to a wedding?

32:04.625 --> 32:07.000
Welcome you guys
to Master Duong's library.

32:07.750 --> 32:09.041
There are a lot of books here,

32:09.250 --> 32:10.750
all kinds of genres.

32:10.875 --> 32:12.666
Hey Vinh, why don't you
show Mien the books.

32:12.958 --> 32:14.541
I'm going out to grill some corn.

32:14.991 --> 32:16.032
Got it?

32:22.563 --> 32:24.271
Do you come here often?

32:24.920 --> 32:28.211
Well yeah, I sometimes come here.

32:33.255 --> 32:34.380
Mien.

32:35.083 --> 32:38.583
This side of the cabinet is for
books by Vietnamese authors.

32:40.458 --> 32:42.250
Each rack for a different genre.

32:42.708 --> 32:45.125
But mostly it's literature.

32:58.920 --> 33:00.920
And over here, these lower compartments,

33:01.041 --> 33:03.000
here, too, are wuxia stories.

33:03.726 --> 33:05.268
What kind of books do you like to read?

33:07.166 --> 33:08.541
Let me see.

34:15.083 --> 34:18.875
- What is that smoke?! Phuc, oh Phuc!
- Yes!

34:19.000 --> 34:20.708
- What is this?
- Darn it!

34:21.500 --> 34:23.791
What's causing the smoke?

34:24.000 --> 34:26.500
- Oh Phuc, Phuc!
- Darn it!

34:28.250 --> 34:30.000
Hey Phuc hey Phuc! Phuc! Phuc!

34:34.750 --> 34:35.958
Hello sir.

34:39.625 --> 34:41.250
You two...

34:42.750 --> 34:43.916
I'm speechless.

34:44.375 --> 34:46.333
You two set the cornfield
on fire as kids years ago.

34:46.375 --> 34:50.166
Now you're all grown up, you want to
burn my house and garden down?

34:50.416 --> 34:53.375
Are you trying to destroy
the whole village?

34:53.541 --> 34:55.144
I thought you wouldn't return
until afternoon...

34:55.168 --> 34:56.208
You're talking back now?

34:56.291 --> 34:57.791
Luckily I got home in time!

34:57.958 --> 34:59.666
Or else...

34:59.791 --> 35:02.625
- Grandpa, it's also my fault...
- No need to defend him.

35:04.333 --> 35:05.916
He started everything.

35:06.375 --> 35:07.625
I know him.

35:10.208 --> 35:11.458
Why are you laughing?

35:12.083 --> 35:13.291
Is it funny?

35:14.833 --> 35:16.291
Excuse us, sir. I'm going home now.

35:17.750 --> 35:19.333
- Yes, sir, goodbye.
- Hey!

35:19.984 --> 35:21.025
Yes?

35:21.750 --> 35:23.855
Return the book to its original place.

35:24.833 --> 35:25.958
Sir,

35:26.285 --> 35:28.660
will you please let me borrow it
to read at home?

35:28.708 --> 35:29.791
No!

35:30.199 --> 35:31.905
You can come and read it here
in your free time.

35:32.458 --> 35:35.833
If you don't take good care of my books,
then don't read them!

35:37.329 --> 35:38.413
Hurry up!

35:38.750 --> 35:39.958
Yes, sir.

35:46.708 --> 35:47.750
I'm leaving now, sir.

35:47.821 --> 35:48.987
Bye.

35:49.083 --> 35:50.375
Goodbye, sir.

36:18.713 --> 36:19.755
Hey Phuc!

36:21.625 --> 36:22.708
Hey stop!

36:22.750 --> 36:24.166
Stop, stop!

36:26.121 --> 36:27.246
What?

36:32.166 --> 36:33.875
- There! In front of you!
- Where is that?

36:33.916 --> 36:35.916
- There's a lot here.
- In front of you.

36:36.416 --> 36:38.083
- This one?
- That's right, that's right.

36:38.250 --> 36:41.000
There are many flowers inside, why do you
have to choose the ones out here?

36:41.041 --> 36:42.291
Just pick the buds.

36:42.291 --> 36:43.666
The one in front of you!

36:44.750 --> 36:46.250
Pick the one next to you too.

36:47.717 --> 36:49.173
On the left! Left, left.

36:50.625 --> 36:51.875
Then right next to it.

36:52.875 --> 36:53.958
Keep going.

36:54.250 --> 36:55.416
Right in front of you.

36:55.509 --> 36:56.634
Around there.

36:56.750 --> 36:58.541
Be gentle, don't ruin them.

36:58.666 --> 37:00.458
Come down here and be gentle all you want.

37:01.076 --> 37:04.659
If I go down, you'll have to
go down and pick me up.

37:05.919 --> 37:07.377
That's good, come back.

37:08.375 --> 37:10.708
Oh my gosh, be careful Phuc!

37:10.750 --> 37:12.231
Phuc, oh Phuc!

37:14.750 --> 37:16.041
Damn.

37:18.458 --> 37:19.541
You're all wet.

37:19.833 --> 37:22.791
Shower when you get home,
or you'll get sick.

37:23.375 --> 37:24.541
And this is for you.

37:27.875 --> 37:29.500
Did I owe you in my previous life, Vinh?

37:39.386 --> 37:40.443
Dad!

37:40.880 --> 37:41.922
Oh, Phuc!

37:45.916 --> 37:48.000
- Did you just got home?
- Yeah, just.

37:48.666 --> 37:50.791
Oh my gosh, where did you go
to get so wet?

37:51.125 --> 37:52.666
Take off your clothes, I'll rinse you.

38:09.291 --> 38:10.916
Oh my gosh, this must cost
a fortune, right Dad?

38:11.341 --> 38:13.000
I thought it through.

38:13.248 --> 38:14.331
I've thought it through.

38:14.500 --> 38:16.375
There is no photography shop
in our village.

38:16.416 --> 38:17.958
One day I will quit driving,

38:18.041 --> 38:19.750
and come back here to open a shop.

38:19.958 --> 38:21.541
We can run it together, okay?

38:22.208 --> 38:23.500
- Really, Dad?
- Of course!

38:23.708 --> 38:26.125
- When will you come home for good?
- Soon.

38:26.958 --> 38:28.875
In the meantime, you learn
how to use the camera first.

38:28.916 --> 38:30.291
- Okay?
- Yes sir!

39:22.032 --> 39:23.157
Mien!

39:34.500 --> 39:35.958
Sit here, it's ours.

39:43.458 --> 39:44.583
How long have you been here?

39:45.208 --> 39:46.333
A while.

39:48.375 --> 39:50.000
I don't know where Vinh is.

39:50.166 --> 39:51.583
We lost a spot since he was late.

40:12.125 --> 40:14.083
Phuc, you have a camera?

40:15.933 --> 40:17.724
My dad bought it for me.

40:18.274 --> 40:21.399
He said this camera is
the best one right now.

40:35.291 --> 40:36.458
Must be very beautiful.

40:36.500 --> 40:37.625
Great!

40:37.666 --> 40:38.875
The movie hasn't started yet.

40:39.083 --> 40:40.166
You fool!

40:40.208 --> 40:41.750
Didn't think you'd make it before it ends.

40:44.924 --> 40:46.000
Ah, sit down, sit down.

40:48.100 --> 40:49.475
You sit here and watch the movie.

40:49.500 --> 40:51.208
I'm gonna buy some ice-cream.

41:00.862 --> 41:01.904
This is for you.

41:03.792 --> 41:04.875
Thank you, Vinh.

41:11.291 --> 41:12.541
The movie is starting!

41:21.916 --> 41:25.041
[The Bitterness of Love]

41:27.373 --> 41:29.093
Hey, what is it?

41:29.140 --> 41:30.793
Hey you little rascals! Go away!

41:30.861 --> 41:31.861
What is it?

41:37.500 --> 41:38.625
 Give you a ride?
But I also walk. 

41:38.916 --> 41:40.291
Please walk with me.

41:41.083 --> 41:43.333
Please walk with me
pass that mansion.

41:44.541 --> 41:45.958
That family has a son who
waits for me

41:46.041 --> 41:47.708
every day to come home from school.

41:49.125 --> 41:50.416
His language...

41:52.029 --> 41:53.154
I'm a passerby...

41:53.208 --> 41:54.625
Oh my gosh! Mr. Quang!

41:55.708 --> 41:57.166
Come in here, you're all wet.

42:26.885 --> 42:28.052
The movie is so good!

42:28.373 --> 42:29.373
Hey!

42:30.505 --> 42:32.000
Could you watch it, Phuc?

42:32.250 --> 42:34.791
Yes, I was standing by the projector.

42:36.375 --> 42:38.333
Which scene do you like the most?

42:39.750 --> 42:42.958
The scene where the male lead climbs the
wall to give flowers to the female lead.

42:44.016 --> 42:45.224
I also like that scene.

42:45.875 --> 42:48.541
I'm leaving now.
My brother is waiting for me.

42:58.595 --> 42:59.678
How's it going?

43:02.730 --> 43:03.772
How's what?

43:05.250 --> 43:06.625
The love confession thing.

43:09.365 --> 43:10.407
Well...

43:10.625 --> 43:12.125
I gave Mien the lotus flowers,

43:12.875 --> 43:14.416
surely she understands.

43:17.083 --> 43:18.125
Dude!

43:18.458 --> 43:19.750
I gave you my seat
and stood the whole evening

43:19.791 --> 43:21.916
to watch the movie, but you
didn't get anything done?

43:22.500 --> 43:23.750
Gosh!

43:24.375 --> 43:26.291
There were so many people around...

43:28.875 --> 43:31.791
Stop giving excuses.
There were only you two at my house

43:31.833 --> 43:33.375
you couldn't say anything either.

43:36.750 --> 43:38.333
I don't know what she thinks.

43:40.708 --> 43:42.125
What if she doesn't like me...

43:44.583 --> 43:46.333
Dude, you're pissing me off!

43:51.146 --> 43:52.188
Alright.

43:53.391 --> 43:54.474
Leave it to me.

43:56.579 --> 43:57.621
Hey!

43:58.754 --> 44:00.045
What are you planning to do?

44:02.936 --> 44:04.519
To clear things up.

44:07.386 --> 44:09.927
Clear what up?

44:11.801 --> 44:13.176
You just wait.

44:13.208 --> 44:14.291
Hey!

44:14.637 --> 44:15.721
Shrimp Tail!

44:16.083 --> 44:17.708
Dude! Hey!

44:23.210 --> 44:24.501
The pulling force

44:24.875 --> 44:27.166
always points towards
the equilibrium position

44:27.416 --> 44:29.958
has a magnitude proportional to
the degree of displacement,

44:30.083 --> 44:31.770
and is the object that causes acceleration

44:31.875 --> 44:33.166
for the oscillating object.

44:50.708 --> 44:51.750
Thanks.

45:01.458 --> 45:03.291
Get in positions! Let's go!

45:04.916 --> 45:06.666
Follow them!

45:12.291 --> 45:13.541
You're supposed to stand here.

45:21.705 --> 45:22.705
Take that!

45:23.018 --> 45:24.217
Yes! That's it.

45:25.250 --> 45:27.541
- You can't play like that.
- I'm just following him.

45:27.708 --> 45:29.083
Foul, penalty.

45:47.291 --> 45:48.458
That was a shit kick.

45:48.833 --> 45:51.375
- Leave me alone.
- I didn't want to play with you either.

45:56.208 --> 45:57.458
Damn!

46:04.036 --> 46:05.161
What's wrong?

46:05.739 --> 46:06.781
Shrimp Tail?

46:08.291 --> 46:09.458
I'm okay.

46:10.291 --> 46:11.416
I'm fine.

46:12.000 --> 46:13.083
Fine?

46:14.291 --> 46:16.708
So why did you intentionally miss the goal?

46:18.458 --> 46:20.166
What do you mean? I...

46:20.625 --> 46:22.750
The sun was blinding so...

46:27.420 --> 46:28.420
Hey!

46:28.750 --> 46:30.583
Can I stop by your house

46:30.750 --> 46:32.750
and borrow a book to read at home later?

46:34.208 --> 46:35.250
Are you crazy?

46:36.000 --> 46:38.750
You know how my grandpa
never let anyone bring books home.

46:40.375 --> 46:42.708
But I thought he changed the rules.

46:42.888 --> 46:45.430
I saw Mien was reading the book
"The Lady of the Camellias".

46:51.625 --> 46:52.833
Ah, that one...

46:58.273 --> 47:00.773
I secretly took it from him
to lend her.

47:03.291 --> 47:05.666
Thank you, I will take good care of it.

47:07.625 --> 47:08.708
Goodbye.

47:11.583 --> 47:12.875
How kind you are to her!

47:13.375 --> 47:15.041
Why have I never seen you

47:15.166 --> 47:17.083
sneak out any book for me?

47:17.351 --> 47:18.851
How can you expect me
to do the same for you?

47:18.975 --> 47:20.141
You're a guy,

47:20.203 --> 47:22.333
you can come whenever you want,

47:22.375 --> 47:24.916
stay all day, and read
as many books as you want.

47:25.916 --> 47:27.250
Mien is a girl,

47:27.958 --> 47:29.458
she can only stay for a bit.

47:30.000 --> 47:31.041
Yeah that's right.

47:31.375 --> 47:32.375
Uncle Sau doesn't

47:32.458 --> 47:33.958
let Mien go out often.

47:34.583 --> 47:37.250
He sometimes ask Huong,
the brother to pick her up...

47:40.583 --> 47:42.375
- Skinny Vinh!
- Huh?

47:44.150 --> 47:45.316
What?

47:47.375 --> 47:48.416
I...

47:48.833 --> 47:49.916
What?

47:54.708 --> 47:55.791
Mien!

47:56.491 --> 47:57.532
Yes?

48:03.236 --> 48:04.361
What is it, Phuc?

48:06.500 --> 48:07.708
Well, in our class...

48:08.375 --> 48:09.458
What about it?

48:13.079 --> 48:15.305
Do you know that in our class,
there is a boy who really likes you?

48:19.052 --> 48:20.218
Then what did she say?

48:24.916 --> 48:26.375
What did she say?

48:28.958 --> 48:30.000
I know.

48:31.500 --> 48:32.750
I like him too.

48:35.954 --> 48:37.579
You know who that is, right?

48:41.708 --> 48:42.958
- It's...
- It's Vinh, right?

48:58.744 --> 49:00.391
Vinh's best friend!

49:36.733 --> 49:37.941
Hit me, Skinny Vinh.

49:47.333 --> 49:48.625
You didn't do anything wrong.

49:55.250 --> 49:56.416
But...

49:56.557 --> 49:57.564
Or...

50:01.889 --> 50:03.291
Or do you also like Mien?

50:15.298 --> 50:16.340
I do not know.

50:20.536 --> 50:21.833
You say you don't know

50:22.083 --> 50:23.631
it means you already know...

50:24.673 --> 50:25.715
Shrimp Tail.

52:34.434 --> 52:35.642
Did you wait for long?

52:43.291 --> 52:44.833
Where are you taking me today?

52:47.060 --> 52:48.185
It's a secret.

52:50.173 --> 52:51.791
- Hey hey!
- Here's your food.

52:51.833 --> 52:53.375
Look,

52:53.750 --> 52:55.000
is that Mien and Phuc?

52:55.250 --> 52:57.041
Who else can it be?

52:57.250 --> 53:01.000
I wonder if Sau Thoi dares to confront
Master Duong about this.

53:01.041 --> 53:03.250
Why would he?

53:03.375 --> 53:05.791
To become in-laws with Master Duong

53:05.875 --> 53:08.375
is the best thing that can
happen to Sau Thoi's family.

53:08.458 --> 53:10.125
That depends.

53:11.083 --> 53:12.250
Aunties!

53:12.833 --> 53:16.375
They're just going to practice
for the class performance.

53:16.458 --> 53:17.958
- Oh, is that so?
- Yes!

53:18.125 --> 53:20.666
- Practicing?
- They're doing something else.

53:20.833 --> 53:24.041
They can fool you kids, but not us.

53:24.095 --> 53:25.333
Isn't that right?

53:25.875 --> 53:26.875
Hey!

53:26.916 --> 53:29.208
- Bring it in for your uncle to cut.
- Let's eat.

53:29.416 --> 53:32.405
Kids these days...

54:00.166 --> 54:01.375
So beautiful.

54:02.458 --> 54:04.208
How did you know this place?

54:31.458 --> 54:32.500
The water is so cool.

54:38.991 --> 54:39.991
Mien...

54:40.375 --> 54:41.708
What do you want to do in the future?

54:44.958 --> 54:46.250
I will study to be a nurse,

54:46.416 --> 54:48.250
and return to work at our commune's clinic.

54:49.458 --> 54:52.041
You are such a good student.
You can become a doctor if you want.

54:55.083 --> 54:56.125
What about you?

54:56.208 --> 54:57.208
What do you want to do?

55:01.166 --> 55:02.416
I don't know yet.

55:04.916 --> 55:06.583
But I want to go everywhere.

55:11.683 --> 55:12.766
What about you?

55:14.140 --> 55:15.265
Where do you want to go?

55:15.635 --> 55:16.760
We can go together.

55:21.125 --> 55:23.041
I want to go to Aunt Hoa's house
in Da Nang,

55:23.833 --> 55:24.958
to visit Lua.

55:28.166 --> 55:29.375
Where else?

55:29.831 --> 55:30.956
Where else?

55:33.835 --> 55:35.044
Probably Saigon.

55:36.375 --> 55:37.916
I heard it's fun in there.

55:40.458 --> 55:42.208
So we will go to Da Nang to visit Lua,

55:43.137 --> 55:44.547
then have fun in Saigon.

55:46.219 --> 55:48.761
After that, we continue down
to the Mekong Delta.

55:50.958 --> 55:52.041
Afterward...

55:57.750 --> 55:59.208
we go wherever we want to go.

56:00.208 --> 56:01.583
Do whatever we want to do.

56:03.596 --> 56:04.762
Sounds good?

57:02.916 --> 57:03.958
This too, uncle.

57:14.708 --> 57:15.875
Why are you so sad?

57:18.583 --> 57:20.125
Just had a fight with your girlfriend?

57:26.250 --> 57:27.583
Thinking about it...

57:28.875 --> 57:30.458
I think love is just like

57:30.958 --> 57:32.625
a treasure-hunting game.

57:34.000 --> 57:35.208
We never know

57:35.708 --> 57:37.291
if we're gonna dig up

57:37.416 --> 57:38.541
gold and silver...

57:40.083 --> 57:41.625
or maybe a piece of broken bowl...

57:42.674 --> 57:43.958
that cuts out finger.

59:34.041 --> 59:35.166
I'll come in first.

59:54.375 --> 59:55.458
Sad!

59:56.375 --> 59:57.416
So sad!

59:57.541 --> 59:59.333
From sadness to embarrasment!

01:00:00.333 --> 01:00:02.541
If I were Mien, I would also choose Phuc.

01:00:02.833 --> 01:00:04.875
- Why is that?
- He grew up so handsome, didn't he?

01:00:07.916 --> 01:00:09.500
Did you guys know that

01:00:09.583 --> 01:00:11.583
Phuc takes Mien
to the forest every week?

01:00:11.608 --> 01:00:13.650
- Doing what?
- Adult things, of course.

01:00:15.291 --> 01:00:17.125
And you know because you stalk them?

01:00:17.208 --> 01:00:19.333
Like I need to stalk them.
All couples are the same!

01:00:19.375 --> 01:00:21.500
Yep, all couples are like that.

01:00:21.541 --> 01:00:24.583
Just like her sister Lua
and uncle Duong back then.

01:00:24.833 --> 01:00:26.041
Those two

01:00:26.291 --> 01:00:28.166
- They're just friends.
- Friends my ass.

01:00:28.208 --> 01:00:29.958
You're stupid if you believe that.

01:00:31.990 --> 01:00:32.990
You beat me?

01:00:33.041 --> 01:00:35.833
Hit him! That's right! Hit him!

01:00:35.916 --> 01:00:37.500
Beat him up! Go! Hit him!

01:00:37.708 --> 01:00:39.166
Hit him! Hit him!

01:00:39.666 --> 01:00:41.750
That's right!

01:00:47.600 --> 01:00:49.728
You too, Shrimp Tail?

01:00:56.494 --> 01:00:57.578
What's going on?

01:00:57.625 --> 01:00:58.833
Let him go!

01:01:00.916 --> 01:01:02.125
You guys break them up!

01:01:08.839 --> 01:01:09.880
Skinny Vinh!

01:01:20.666 --> 01:01:21.875
Get on, I'll take you home.

01:01:36.958 --> 01:01:38.083
- Hey!
- Huh?

01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:40.958
When you and Mien hang out,

01:01:41.208 --> 01:01:42.500
take me with you.

01:01:44.916 --> 01:01:46.750
Are you no longer angry with me and Mien?

01:01:47.625 --> 01:01:48.708
Who said?

01:01:50.250 --> 01:01:51.375
It's just...

01:01:52.708 --> 01:01:55.041
I cannot have a girlfriend,

01:01:55.791 --> 01:01:57.500
I cannot afford to lose my only friend.

01:01:58.041 --> 01:01:59.833
As long as you and Mien are happy, I am ok.

01:02:02.416 --> 01:02:03.583
Okay.

01:02:04.416 --> 01:02:06.083
There's a seat now, sit down.

01:02:06.423 --> 01:02:07.548
Nope.

01:02:08.291 --> 01:02:10.833
This saddle you installed
for your girlfriend.

01:02:11.041 --> 01:02:12.291
Not for me.

01:02:13.625 --> 01:02:15.125
Talking back today?

01:02:15.500 --> 01:02:18.375
I have been standing like this for years.
I am ok.

01:02:20.458 --> 01:02:22.250
- Sit down.
- Nope!

01:02:23.083 --> 01:02:24.583
- Will you sit down?
- Nope!

01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:26.208
Are you sure?

01:02:27.500 --> 01:02:29.041
- Hey! What the heck!
- Are you sure?

01:02:29.541 --> 01:02:31.625
Hey! Hey Shrimp Tail!

01:02:33.875 --> 01:02:35.083
You jerk!

01:02:37.458 --> 01:02:39.875
Damn, it's cushioned too.

01:02:40.081 --> 01:02:41.016
Of course.

01:02:41.100 --> 01:02:42.208
Here comes food!

01:02:43.353 --> 01:02:44.733
- Thanks, Mien.
- Thank you ma'am.

01:02:44.780 --> 01:02:46.900
- Okay, enjoy your meal.
- Thank you, grandma.

01:02:46.960 --> 01:02:47.753
Yes, ma'am.

01:02:48.375 --> 01:02:49.950
What do you wanna eat?

01:02:51.125 --> 01:02:52.583
I can do it myself.

01:02:56.066 --> 01:02:57.400
Have you two done your homework yet?

01:02:57.541 --> 01:02:59.666
- Do we have homework?
- Yes, in Physics.

01:04:25.708 --> 01:04:28.208
Hey Phuc, I just put in a new
film roll for you.

01:04:28.625 --> 01:04:30.125
Yes, thank you dad.

01:04:30.500 --> 01:04:31.666
The photos turn out great.

01:04:31.708 --> 01:04:32.833
Have you seen them?

01:04:33.458 --> 01:04:34.583
Aren't I good?

01:04:39.083 --> 01:04:40.375
Nice!

01:04:41.916 --> 01:04:43.541
You're going pro soon.

01:04:45.333 --> 01:04:47.166
The house is almost blown away,

01:04:47.541 --> 01:04:50.458
and you two only care about nonsense.

01:04:50.666 --> 01:04:52.791
Be considerate and help out.

01:05:03.083 --> 01:05:05.333
You don't teach him
good and righteous things.

01:05:06.250 --> 01:05:08.541
- Only bad--
- What's bad, Dad?

01:05:08.666 --> 01:05:10.750
- What do you mean by that?
- So what is this?

01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:12.458
What is this?

01:05:14.125 --> 01:05:15.250
Huh?

01:05:15.458 --> 01:05:17.500
Chuoc oh Chuoc!

01:05:17.791 --> 01:05:22.125
Will you please let him focus on studying?

01:05:22.416 --> 01:05:26.500
If not, when he grows up,
this village will have another loser.

01:05:27.041 --> 01:05:29.208
Father! What do you mean by that?

01:05:29.250 --> 01:05:31.000
Am I wrong? Huh?

01:05:31.750 --> 01:05:32.916
Like...

01:05:33.208 --> 01:05:34.291
Am I wrong?

01:05:35.541 --> 01:05:36.666
Father!

01:05:40.125 --> 01:05:41.625
These photos are...

01:05:42.500 --> 01:05:45.083
Dad plans to return to our village
to open a photography shop!

01:05:45.541 --> 01:05:47.563
Okay! Good!

01:05:48.791 --> 01:05:51.848
Just wait and you'll see.

01:06:00.291 --> 01:06:02.375
Urgent storm news! Storm number 1.

01:06:02.416 --> 01:06:03.894
Currently at the center of the storm,

01:06:03.972 --> 01:06:06.698
the wind is level 15,
with gusts at level 17.

01:06:06.758 --> 01:06:09.658
The National Center for
Hydrometeorological Forecasting warned...

01:06:09.958 --> 01:06:12.708
- Pack things quickly, the storm is coming.
- Yes!

01:06:12.916 --> 01:06:15.666
Full bottle, please.
Put it on my tab.

01:06:24.125 --> 01:06:25.500
Vinh!

01:06:26.333 --> 01:06:29.458
After finishing cleaning,
run upstairs to close the windows.

01:06:29.500 --> 01:06:31.416
- Yes, grandma.
- The bill please, ma'am.

01:06:32.125 --> 01:06:33.333
Give him the check, son.

01:06:41.458 --> 01:06:43.000
Clean up then go close the window.

01:06:43.041 --> 01:06:44.250
Yes, grandma.

01:07:28.541 --> 01:07:30.000
- Vinh?
- Yes, teacher.

01:07:30.041 --> 01:07:31.875
- Let's move it over there.
- Got it.

01:07:31.960 --> 01:07:35.256
[Class 12A
Attending 29/30, Absent 1]

01:07:48.333 --> 01:07:49.458
Phuc!

01:08:03.791 --> 01:08:04.958
Phuc!

01:08:07.000 --> 01:08:08.083
Master!

01:08:18.531 --> 01:08:19.572
Phuc!

01:08:21.708 --> 01:08:22.875
Master!

01:08:29.000 --> 01:08:30.083
Hello sir.

01:08:34.208 --> 01:08:35.333
Is Phuc home?

01:08:41.250 --> 01:08:42.791
Maybe his father...

01:08:43.833 --> 01:08:45.291
took him away for good.

01:09:36.875 --> 01:09:38.083
The finals

01:09:38.492 --> 01:09:40.016
are coming very soon.

01:09:41.291 --> 01:09:43.958
Start looking at picking your
tertiary school.

01:10:23.125 --> 01:10:24.291
Mien!

01:10:27.393 --> 01:10:29.726
- Can you take me home today?
- Okay.

01:10:42.545 --> 01:10:43.586
Mien.

01:10:44.500 --> 01:10:46.708
Have you...

01:10:46.958 --> 01:10:48.166
picked a school?

01:10:52.583 --> 01:10:54.500
Lua is about to give birth
to her first child.

01:10:54.958 --> 01:10:57.875
So my mother told me to go to
Da Nang to take care of her.

01:10:58.666 --> 01:10:59.708
Huh?

01:11:03.571 --> 01:11:05.362
When are you leaving?

01:11:05.954 --> 01:11:07.163
How long will you be gone?

01:11:13.708 --> 01:11:15.083
I don't know.

01:11:19.583 --> 01:11:20.708
But...

01:11:21.416 --> 01:11:23.083
The finals are coming.

01:11:48.670 --> 01:11:50.541
If we don't look up at the sky,

01:11:50.666 --> 01:11:53.416
we'll never get to see the birds, right?

01:11:53.791 --> 01:11:54.875
Right!

01:11:56.583 --> 01:11:58.458
If you hadn't skipped class
and hadn't met me,

01:11:58.500 --> 01:12:00.875
I would never know
that you existed in the world.

01:12:04.884 --> 01:12:06.509
But how do you know of this place?

01:12:10.500 --> 01:12:12.458
When I was little, my friends
and I used to...

01:12:13.230 --> 01:12:14.230
hide up here.

01:12:15.777 --> 01:12:19.194
When I grew up and fell in love,
we went on dates here.

01:12:21.208 --> 01:12:22.750
What does "falling in love" mean?

01:12:31.939 --> 01:12:34.230
It's like your father and mother.

01:12:35.474 --> 01:12:38.041
Your parents met, fell in love,

01:12:38.332 --> 01:12:39.957
got married and have you.

01:12:48.791 --> 01:12:50.291
Su, be careful.

01:12:50.583 --> 01:12:52.041
It's very dangerous to play there.

01:12:52.458 --> 01:12:54.458
Don't come up here alone.

01:12:54.750 --> 01:12:56.166
You need an adult with you.

01:13:19.463 --> 01:13:24.257
[August 1997]

01:13:56.166 --> 01:13:58.041
Master, have some food.

01:14:19.375 --> 01:14:21.000
How long have you been back to Pho Thi?

01:14:21.919 --> 01:14:23.377
I came back last year.

01:14:23.785 --> 01:14:26.080
My brother Huong went to Da Nang
to help Aunt Hoa.

01:14:26.455 --> 01:14:28.872
There was no one left at home,
so I came back.

01:14:31.916 --> 01:14:34.375
Ah... Sis Lua's child...

01:14:34.666 --> 01:14:36.416
Must be about four years old now, right?

01:14:49.833 --> 01:14:51.458
Since Master had a stroke,

01:14:51.875 --> 01:14:54.291
my father told me to come and
take care of him every day.

01:14:54.953 --> 01:14:56.911
Poor him, he's all alone now.

01:15:12.333 --> 01:15:13.416
And...

01:15:13.583 --> 01:15:16.083
- Have you heard any news from Shrimp T--?
- No.

01:15:36.916 --> 01:15:39.416
If grandma knew you're going to
teach at our village school

01:15:39.583 --> 01:15:40.916
she would be very happy.

01:15:43.916 --> 01:15:45.250
Our hometown specialties.

01:15:48.166 --> 01:15:49.375
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

01:15:54.625 --> 01:15:56.458
So... When will you get married?

01:15:59.166 --> 01:16:00.666
Jeez, you sound like grandma.

01:16:01.833 --> 01:16:03.125
Then...

01:16:05.125 --> 01:16:07.906
I am... waiting for my reward.

01:16:09.520 --> 01:16:10.697
What reward?

01:16:12.041 --> 01:16:13.208
That's what you

01:16:13.333 --> 01:16:14.666
told me back then

01:16:16.291 --> 01:16:17.500
love...

01:16:17.666 --> 01:16:19.333
grows naturally,

01:16:20.250 --> 01:16:22.166
in the end, you will receive your reward,

01:16:22.416 --> 01:16:23.541
that is love.

01:16:27.625 --> 01:16:29.041
Oh, I said that?

01:16:44.583 --> 01:16:46.333
Uh, everyone...

01:16:46.583 --> 01:16:47.666
Yes ma'am,

01:16:47.756 --> 01:16:50.177
please allow the young man and
his family to come in and talk.

01:16:51.541 --> 01:16:53.208
What do you think?

01:16:53.291 --> 01:16:55.351
I think it's great.

01:16:55.541 --> 01:16:59.250
After all, Le has liked Mien
since they were just kids.

01:16:59.333 --> 01:17:01.875
They are very close, right?

01:17:02.500 --> 01:17:03.541
Yes, that's right.

01:17:03.708 --> 01:17:06.795
So it's fate and destiny for
these two to come together.

01:17:07.250 --> 01:17:10.583
If you two approve, then please
accept his glass of wine.

01:17:10.625 --> 01:17:14.000
Then his family will choose
a good date for the wedding.

01:17:15.828 --> 01:17:16.911
Yes yes.

01:17:19.458 --> 01:17:20.541
Please accept this.

01:17:22.500 --> 01:17:23.541
Here are for you.

01:17:36.750 --> 01:17:38.083
We're in the middle of something,

01:17:38.208 --> 01:17:39.916
please have a drink.

01:17:40.500 --> 01:17:42.333
Huh, hey?

01:17:42.583 --> 01:17:44.000
- Where are you going?
- Hey?

01:18:04.541 --> 01:18:06.041
What are you doing?

01:18:06.541 --> 01:18:07.916
I think Le is fine.

01:18:09.083 --> 01:18:11.166
His parents are kind
and his family is well off.

01:18:16.625 --> 01:18:17.875
Oh my gosh.

01:18:17.932 --> 01:18:20.292
Who are you waiting for
that you don't want to get married?

01:18:20.375 --> 01:18:22.375
You rejected Cu Em.

01:18:22.500 --> 01:18:24.000
And now you're rejecting Le.

01:18:24.833 --> 01:18:26.333
Who else do you want to wait for?

01:18:34.041 --> 01:18:37.416
I love you because I hate sadness

01:18:38.166 --> 01:18:42.041
I love you because I hate anger

01:18:42.208 --> 01:18:48.416
I love you because I despise lies

01:18:50.291 --> 01:18:53.916
I love you because I'm bored of people

01:18:54.375 --> 01:18:57.875
I love you because I'm bored with life

01:18:58.333 --> 01:19:04.375
I love you because
I don't believe in heaven.

01:19:06.405 --> 01:19:08.313
Love is something
you have to feel with your heart,

01:19:09.291 --> 01:19:11.348
but it is also something
you need to put into words.

01:19:12.166 --> 01:19:15.791
We can't just expect people
to read our minds

01:19:16.416 --> 01:19:19.625
like superheroes. Right?

01:19:29.208 --> 01:19:32.333
- I'll send you a message. Go home.
- Okay.

01:19:44.708 --> 01:19:46.333
Good. Come over here.

01:19:54.541 --> 01:19:55.625
Oh Vinh?

01:19:57.375 --> 01:19:58.666
You're Vinh, right?

01:19:59.166 --> 01:20:00.250
That's me.

01:20:00.500 --> 01:20:01.583
Lua.

01:20:01.663 --> 01:20:02.871
Oh my gosh.

01:20:03.250 --> 01:20:06.375
You're so handsome
and look much more mature now.

01:20:08.237 --> 01:20:10.237
You're taking him home?

01:20:10.291 --> 01:20:12.416
Yeah, so he can visit his grandparents.

01:20:12.666 --> 01:20:14.458
Besides, I am expecting another one soon,

01:20:14.875 --> 01:20:16.666
I'm afraid I won't be able to do it alone.

01:20:17.466 --> 01:20:18.466
I see.

01:20:21.250 --> 01:20:22.333
What's your name?

01:20:22.375 --> 01:20:23.541
My name is Su.

01:20:24.349 --> 01:20:25.433
Huong!

01:20:27.708 --> 01:20:28.875
Hello Huong.

01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:31.083
Thank you.

01:20:32.708 --> 01:20:34.833
- Good bye.
- Bye Vinh.

01:21:01.708 --> 01:21:03.000
When I was cooking earlier,

01:21:03.458 --> 01:21:06.125
Mom told me that Le came over
to ask for your hand?

01:21:07.208 --> 01:21:09.833
You know Le and Cu Em used to

01:21:10.125 --> 01:21:13.625
shoot at me with a slingshot
every day at school?

01:21:19.163 --> 01:21:20.329
What about Vinh?

01:21:22.291 --> 01:21:23.458
What about him?

01:21:24.083 --> 01:21:25.750
When I got off the bus in the morning,

01:21:25.875 --> 01:21:27.000
I met him.

01:21:27.958 --> 01:21:29.208
Now

01:21:30.166 --> 01:21:31.875
he's less skinny than before.

01:21:32.416 --> 01:21:34.041
And really handsome.

01:22:01.141 --> 01:22:02.183
Sister.

01:22:05.166 --> 01:22:06.791
Have you ever

01:22:08.583 --> 01:22:10.041
missed your ex?

01:22:19.583 --> 01:22:20.625
Or course.

01:22:24.541 --> 01:22:25.875
Sometimes I even cried.

01:22:29.862 --> 01:22:30.987
Then that's it.

01:22:49.833 --> 01:22:51.125
Ex's...

01:22:52.791 --> 01:22:54.541
No matter how much you loved them,

01:22:56.208 --> 01:22:58.125
it's already in the past.

01:23:00.041 --> 01:23:01.833
What important is

01:23:03.041 --> 01:23:04.458
the person next to you right now.

01:23:21.893 --> 01:23:23.873
- Hold tightly here.
- Okay.

01:23:35.338 --> 01:23:36.463
Mien!

01:23:43.166 --> 01:23:44.291
Lua has just delivered a baby,

01:23:44.333 --> 01:23:46.500
so my parents
went to Da Nang to visit her.

01:23:47.958 --> 01:23:50.625
So there are only you two at home?

01:23:50.666 --> 01:23:54.500
Yeah, so I've been taking him
with me everywhere I go.

01:23:55.750 --> 01:23:58.166
Now that you are a big brother,
are you happy, Su?

01:23:59.166 --> 01:24:00.625
I miss my mom.

01:24:00.833 --> 01:24:03.625
I want mom.

01:24:06.442 --> 01:24:07.500
What's wrong Vinh?

01:24:08.500 --> 01:24:09.833
Su misses his mother.

01:24:15.041 --> 01:24:17.583
I am very proud of
the fruits of my labor.

01:24:17.625 --> 01:24:19.375
The days just go by...

01:24:19.791 --> 01:24:23.708
Behold the cricket, behold the cricket

01:24:23.708 --> 01:24:26.514
Spread your wings, spread your wings

01:24:27.000 --> 01:24:28.458
Now look at me.

01:24:30.250 --> 01:24:31.791
Then put down a stick.

01:24:31.833 --> 01:24:34.541
One two three.

01:24:34.541 --> 01:24:37.041
So there are three sticks, right?

01:24:37.083 --> 01:24:41.416
- Su, try counting.
- One two three.

01:24:41.541 --> 01:24:42.875
Very good.

01:24:44.375 --> 01:24:45.666
Very good.

01:24:50.625 --> 01:24:52.916
What are you drawing? Who's this?

01:24:53.291 --> 01:24:54.916
My parents.

01:24:55.250 --> 01:24:56.998
- What about that?
- That's me.

01:24:57.833 --> 01:24:59.833
- Over here.
- My sister.

01:25:00.166 --> 01:25:03.578
- What about here?
- Uncle Vinh is driving Aunt Mien.

01:25:24.750 --> 01:25:27.416
I should've been more compassionate,
and let Chui

01:25:27.666 --> 01:25:29.458
dig an alley to my house.

01:25:31.125 --> 01:25:32.625
Let's eat.

01:25:36.973 --> 01:25:38.791
What's wrong? Egg is your favourite.

01:25:40.750 --> 01:25:42.235
Let uncle Vinh feed you.

01:25:42.916 --> 01:25:44.425
Okay, Su is very good.

01:25:44.916 --> 01:25:46.208
Now, open your mouth.

01:25:51.208 --> 01:25:52.333
He is so hot.

01:25:53.041 --> 01:25:54.291
He has a fever.

01:26:41.664 --> 01:26:44.250
I'm here with you, it's okay, Su.

01:26:44.375 --> 01:26:45.500
Mom...

01:26:47.000 --> 01:26:49.250
- Mom...
- Auntie is here.

01:26:52.333 --> 01:26:53.458
Mommy...

01:26:54.332 --> 01:26:56.082
Auntie is here with you, Su.

01:26:57.958 --> 01:26:59.208
Mommy...

01:26:59.541 --> 01:27:00.708
Mom...

01:27:00.958 --> 01:27:02.375
Mommy...

01:27:10.916 --> 01:27:12.083
It's mom, Su.

01:27:13.041 --> 01:27:14.500
I am your mother.

01:27:14.636 --> 01:27:16.469
I want to go home with mommy.

01:28:23.125 --> 01:28:24.166
Su...

01:28:26.083 --> 01:28:27.458
is my son,

01:28:31.500 --> 01:28:32.500
mine and Phuc's.

01:28:43.251 --> 01:28:44.960
Before Phuc left,

01:28:45.875 --> 01:28:47.000
he came to me...

01:28:47.666 --> 01:28:48.958
I have to leave.

01:28:49.541 --> 01:28:50.625
Where are you going?

01:28:51.916 --> 01:28:53.416
I don't know, but...

01:28:54.250 --> 01:28:55.791
my dad said I have to leave now.

01:28:56.041 --> 01:28:57.666
When are you coming back?

01:29:00.416 --> 01:29:03.416
- I don't know.
- Why don't you know anything?

01:29:06.291 --> 01:29:07.666
I asked dad, but he...

01:29:08.458 --> 01:29:10.208
he didn't tell me anything.

01:29:15.166 --> 01:29:16.583
I will return for sure.

01:29:17.666 --> 01:29:18.750
I promise you.

01:29:21.291 --> 01:29:22.583
Wait for me.

01:29:27.125 --> 01:29:28.333
I will.

01:30:18.612 --> 01:30:20.654
You will come back to me, right?

01:30:21.125 --> 01:30:22.416
I will come back.

01:30:23.934 --> 01:30:25.351
I will definitely return.

01:30:26.958 --> 01:30:28.291
Please wait for me.

01:31:16.958 --> 01:31:19.041
But he did not return.

01:31:31.583 --> 01:31:33.333
A few months after Phuc was gone,

01:31:33.916 --> 01:31:35.851
I found out I got pregnant.

01:32:00.916 --> 01:32:03.666
Then my parents sent me to Da Nang,

01:32:04.041 --> 01:32:05.375
to give birth to baby Su.

01:32:06.666 --> 01:32:08.875
As for Lua,
she had just gotten married at that time,

01:32:09.291 --> 01:32:11.208
so she took Su as her child,

01:32:12.125 --> 01:32:13.833
so it didn't become a scandal.

01:32:29.333 --> 01:32:30.791
During that time,

01:32:31.920 --> 01:32:33.712
I was waiting,

01:32:35.793 --> 01:32:38.085
but news about Phuc

01:32:42.316 --> 01:32:43.525
never came.

01:34:22.424 --> 01:34:23.632
Master...

01:34:26.000 --> 01:34:27.041
Master...

01:34:27.736 --> 01:34:28.777
Master!

01:34:30.416 --> 01:34:32.375
Master, it's Skinny Vinh.

01:34:34.916 --> 01:34:36.625
Do you know

01:34:37.291 --> 01:34:38.833
where Shrimp Tail Phuc is?

01:34:39.666 --> 01:34:41.166
Has he contacted you?

01:34:44.666 --> 01:34:45.750
Phuc...

01:34:46.458 --> 01:34:48.041
Shrimp Tail...

01:34:53.916 --> 01:34:55.833
I'm sorry...

01:34:57.500 --> 01:34:59.833
Don't be mad at me.

01:35:00.458 --> 01:35:02.166
Don't leave me alone anymore.

01:35:03.375 --> 01:35:06.416
Come back and help me
build the classroom...

01:35:07.500 --> 01:35:08.875
for the kids.

01:35:10.416 --> 01:35:11.583
Shrimp Tail...

01:35:14.041 --> 01:35:15.250
Grandpa...

01:35:16.875 --> 01:35:18.333
This is Phuc...

01:35:20.291 --> 01:35:21.625
I'm home, Grandpa.

01:35:26.250 --> 01:35:27.666
Come home, help me...

01:35:28.704 --> 01:35:31.579
build the classroom for the kids...

01:35:33.208 --> 01:35:34.583
I promise grandpa

01:35:35.322 --> 01:35:37.239
I will build the classroom for you.

01:35:55.291 --> 01:35:56.337
Vinh.

01:35:56.581 --> 01:35:57.706
Vinh...

01:35:58.696 --> 01:35:59.696
Vinh.

01:36:00.375 --> 01:36:01.875
Have some porridge,
it'll help you feel better.

01:36:01.916 --> 01:36:02.958
Mien.

01:36:24.375 --> 01:36:25.500
Mien,

01:36:25.833 --> 01:36:27.291
go home with Su.

01:36:28.708 --> 01:36:30.041
I can take care of myself.

01:36:32.125 --> 01:36:33.666
My parents are back.

01:36:33.750 --> 01:36:35.416
Su has grandparents to take care of him.

01:36:35.583 --> 01:36:37.666
You have no one.

01:36:45.125 --> 01:36:46.291
So delicious.

01:36:58.916 --> 01:37:00.083
Mien.

01:37:01.083 --> 01:37:02.750
I need to tell you something.

01:37:05.958 --> 01:37:07.666
Something I should have

01:37:08.091 --> 01:37:10.007
told you a long time ago.

01:37:13.662 --> 01:37:15.000
Do you remember

01:37:16.092 --> 01:37:17.458
the first days

01:37:18.623 --> 01:37:21.331
we walked into the same classroom?

01:37:25.000 --> 01:37:26.208
I have been trying

01:37:26.500 --> 01:37:28.750
to figure out my feelings for you...

01:37:32.083 --> 01:37:33.541
Up until today.

01:37:36.151 --> 01:37:38.026
I want to tell you that...

01:37:42.264 --> 01:37:43.473
I love you.

01:37:59.565 --> 01:38:01.863
You really don't have to tell me this.

01:38:03.750 --> 01:38:06.500
Because... All this time,

01:38:06.750 --> 01:38:08.573
I have always known your feelings...

01:38:09.625 --> 01:38:11.250
- But I--
- Let's get married.

01:38:16.955 --> 01:38:19.250
I will consider Su my own child.

01:38:23.208 --> 01:38:26.578
You are not mad I have been hiding
Su's identity from you all those years?

01:38:27.690 --> 01:38:28.815
Of course I am.

01:38:33.666 --> 01:38:35.000
But I won't

01:38:35.500 --> 01:38:36.791
give up my dream

01:38:37.083 --> 01:38:38.583
just because of that.

01:38:40.875 --> 01:38:41.958
What dream?

01:38:46.176 --> 01:38:47.384
Since I was a kid,

01:38:48.505 --> 01:38:49.625
I have always dreamed of

01:38:51.897 --> 01:38:53.230
marrying you

01:38:56.666 --> 01:38:58.333
when I grew up.

01:39:25.806 --> 01:39:27.556
Yes, ladies and gentlemen...

01:39:42.750 --> 01:39:44.208
Uncle, please accept this wine.

01:39:44.250 --> 01:39:45.416
Dude!

01:39:45.750 --> 01:39:48.644
Still calling him uncle?

01:39:50.541 --> 01:39:53.250
Father, please accept this wine.

01:40:00.413 --> 01:40:02.913
Mother, please accept my wine.

01:40:06.941 --> 01:40:08.347
Thank you.

01:40:19.281 --> 01:40:21.072
Here comes the bride!

01:40:36.213 --> 01:40:39.379
Auntie Mien is the bride,
Uncle Vinh is the groom!

01:40:41.208 --> 01:40:42.541
Come here, listen to me.

01:40:43.666 --> 01:40:47.041
From now on, you will call her mama Mien.

01:40:47.333 --> 01:40:49.250
Try it.

01:40:49.333 --> 01:40:50.541
Mama Mien.

01:40:53.250 --> 01:40:54.583
Papa Vinh.

01:41:08.791 --> 01:41:10.250
Smile!

01:41:10.250 --> 01:41:11.958
The bride moves closer.

01:41:12.000 --> 01:41:13.333
Bit closer there.

01:41:13.361 --> 01:41:15.069
- Stand close!
- Look straight.

01:41:15.166 --> 01:41:15.907
Beautiful!

01:41:15.931 --> 01:41:18.125
You've gotta look happy
when receiving your reward.

01:41:18.250 --> 01:41:21.958
- One, two, three!
- Come in, Su.

01:41:22.250 --> 01:41:23.583
Smile, Su!

01:43:07.143 --> 01:43:08.393
[August 2000]

01:43:08.500 --> 01:43:12.041
Uncle, please drop me off at
the old market.

01:43:23.083 --> 01:43:25.291
I asked a friend
to buy Da Nang beef patties.

01:43:28.788 --> 01:43:29.996
Darling, the meat!

01:43:35.166 --> 01:43:36.875
Did you come home from work early today?

01:43:38.125 --> 01:43:41.208
It's the same as always.

01:43:43.211 --> 01:43:44.420
But where is Su?

01:43:47.833 --> 01:43:50.458
Oh gosh, I was so cooking
and forgot about the time.

01:43:51.136 --> 01:43:52.470
Let me go pick him up.

01:43:59.958 --> 01:44:01.166
Mom!

01:44:07.333 --> 01:44:09.291
Su, what's wrong?

01:44:09.708 --> 01:44:11.708
I was playing in the forest and fell.

01:44:12.250 --> 01:44:14.000
Mom, this is uncle Phuc,

01:44:14.416 --> 01:44:15.625
my new friend.

01:44:30.077 --> 01:44:31.202
Phuc...

01:44:34.359 --> 01:44:35.484
Shrimp Tail!

01:44:40.101 --> 01:44:41.226
Where have you been?

01:44:41.623 --> 01:44:42.998
Why are you only coming back now?

01:44:58.805 --> 01:44:59.824
When did you come back?

01:45:00.958 --> 01:45:03.333
What took you so long to come find us?

01:45:03.487 --> 01:45:04.879
I've been back for a few days now.

01:45:05.931 --> 01:45:07.389
The kid is very talented, isn't he?

01:45:08.143 --> 01:45:09.559
But he is quite a boy you know.

01:45:09.951 --> 01:45:12.117
There was no way his father,
years ago, could match him now...

01:45:15.841 --> 01:45:16.882
Come,

01:45:18.320 --> 01:45:19.445
have some tea.

01:45:20.375 --> 01:45:21.500
You have liquor?

01:45:22.717 --> 01:45:23.884
One second.

01:45:33.250 --> 01:45:36.267
Dad, Dad, let's eat.

01:45:37.680 --> 01:45:41.226
But I haven't finished
talking to uncle Phuc yet.

01:45:43.355 --> 01:45:44.397
It's fine,

01:45:44.708 --> 01:45:45.916
you guys eat.

01:45:45.958 --> 01:45:47.661
- I'll head out.
- What are you talking about?

01:45:47.791 --> 01:45:49.166
Stay and have dinner with us.

01:45:50.322 --> 01:45:53.072
Honey, remember to cut more beef patties.

01:45:54.583 --> 01:45:55.708
No worries,

01:45:55.974 --> 01:45:57.523
I also have work to do.

01:45:58.655 --> 01:45:59.923
You guys eat.

01:46:02.216 --> 01:46:03.500
You're hungry, aren't you?

01:46:05.833 --> 01:46:06.875
Let me see,

01:46:07.208 --> 01:46:08.291
does it still hurt?

01:46:08.750 --> 01:46:10.666
Nope, no more pain.

01:46:11.791 --> 01:46:14.275
Hang out with me some time.

01:46:14.333 --> 01:46:16.500
When you feel better,
I'll take you out to play again.

01:46:33.375 --> 01:46:34.708
That stream is very nice.

01:46:34.750 --> 01:46:38.125
Uncle Phuc said that back then,
he went up there to play with his friends.

01:46:38.500 --> 01:46:39.875
He spent the night there.

01:46:39.958 --> 01:46:42.041
Then when he fell in love,
he also went there.

01:46:42.291 --> 01:46:44.000
When my leg is all healed,

01:46:44.250 --> 01:46:46.000
let's go camping there.

01:46:47.125 --> 01:46:48.708
But why are you so bold?

01:46:49.666 --> 01:46:51.083
You went out with a stranger!

01:46:51.333 --> 01:46:54.708
It would be dangerous
if uncle Phuc wasn't our friend.

01:46:56.333 --> 01:46:58.125
He is not a stranger.

01:46:58.291 --> 01:47:00.083
I've seen him for a few days now.

01:47:00.583 --> 01:47:02.833
In the future, I want to be a writer.

01:47:02.916 --> 01:47:06.708
To be a writer, you have to
go out to have a lot to tell.

01:47:29.291 --> 01:47:30.291
Su and Phuc...

01:47:31.500 --> 01:47:33.666
met in the guava garden behind the class.

01:47:48.544 --> 01:47:50.685
When I came to pick him up, I saw them.

01:47:55.458 --> 01:47:58.166
I didn't meet or talk to Phuc at all.

01:48:03.458 --> 01:48:05.000
Why didn't you tell me?

01:48:32.637 --> 01:48:34.404
I don't know why.

01:48:35.500 --> 01:48:37.166
I don't know what to do either.

01:48:38.291 --> 01:48:40.666
I just want to let the two of them meet,

01:48:42.612 --> 01:48:44.222
after all they're...

01:50:04.041 --> 01:50:05.958
Su asked to go to Co May's house to play,

01:50:06.041 --> 01:50:07.541
you can pick him up there.

01:50:07.708 --> 01:50:08.916
Yes, thank you.

01:50:17.431 --> 01:50:18.597
Mien!

01:50:30.250 --> 01:50:31.416
Su...

01:50:37.333 --> 01:50:39.125
Is he my son?

01:50:50.375 --> 01:50:51.458
Is he?

01:50:57.208 --> 01:50:58.375
So I could've been

01:50:59.208 --> 01:51:00.791
Su's father,

01:51:02.416 --> 01:51:03.682
and your husband...

01:51:05.583 --> 01:51:07.916
We could have been a family, right?

01:51:25.541 --> 01:51:26.750
The bill please, ma'am.

01:51:49.291 --> 01:51:50.458
Oh my gosh!

01:51:52.041 --> 01:51:53.083
Duong!

01:52:14.833 --> 01:52:17.291
Phuc, are you staying with grandpa,
or coming with me?

01:52:35.791 --> 01:52:37.875
I didn't know that it was a one-way trip.

01:52:42.184 --> 01:52:43.559
During the eight years away,

01:52:44.246 --> 01:52:46.079
I asked him all the time, but...

01:52:47.375 --> 01:52:49.333
he never told me the truth.

01:52:51.160 --> 01:52:52.869
Not until he was dying...

01:53:03.335 --> 01:53:04.418
Duong!

01:53:05.333 --> 01:53:06.541
You're Duong, right?

01:53:09.459 --> 01:53:12.417
In the end, we lost both
our youth and happiness

01:53:12.458 --> 01:53:14.916
because of a disastrous
misunderstanding.

01:53:18.791 --> 01:53:20.375
Those eight long years,

01:53:22.666 --> 01:53:24.333
I never stopped thinking about you.

01:53:27.333 --> 01:53:29.166
[My dearest Mien,]

01:53:34.998 --> 01:53:35.998
Dad!

01:53:36.351 --> 01:53:37.351
Dad, Dad...

01:53:56.166 --> 01:53:57.708
I have been missing you so terribly...

01:54:01.958 --> 01:54:03.407
So why didn't you come back?

01:54:09.447 --> 01:54:11.208
I didn't know where you went,

01:54:11.356 --> 01:54:12.481
what you were doing,

01:54:12.958 --> 01:54:14.762
whether you're coming back.

01:54:20.962 --> 01:54:24.611
[Phuc... Another rainy day in Da Nang...]

01:54:26.833 --> 01:54:27.875
Push!

01:54:29.110 --> 01:54:30.277
Come on.

01:54:36.791 --> 01:54:38.333
Good, good.

01:54:38.708 --> 01:54:40.333
Good, the baby is out.

01:54:40.407 --> 01:54:41.449
Good job.

01:54:50.193 --> 01:54:53.000
The day Vinh
pulled me out of that despair,

01:54:54.083 --> 01:54:56.253
was the day when I must accept that...

01:55:00.697 --> 01:55:01.781
you're dead.

01:55:13.102 --> 01:55:14.268
And now...

01:55:18.417 --> 01:55:19.542
What about now?

01:55:22.500 --> 01:55:23.708
I'm still alive.

01:55:26.791 --> 01:55:27.875
I'm here.

01:55:32.791 --> 01:55:34.416
I'm standing right in front of you.

01:56:09.375 --> 01:56:11.167
Are you happy in those years?

01:56:17.458 --> 01:56:19.833
Have you ever thought about me?

01:56:40.583 --> 01:56:41.666
Come with me.

01:56:44.583 --> 01:56:45.625
Where to?

01:56:47.125 --> 01:56:49.081
I'll take you and Su to Lam Dong.

01:56:50.541 --> 01:56:51.958
We can start again.

01:56:53.791 --> 01:56:56.625
We can travel to everywhere
like we used to dream.

01:57:07.566 --> 01:57:09.514
But why do I have to eat first?

01:57:10.458 --> 01:57:12.833
I want to wait and eat with papa Vinh.

01:57:16.250 --> 01:57:18.250
Dad must be busy with work
so he'll be home late.

01:57:18.791 --> 01:57:21.166
Su, be a good boy.

01:57:21.250 --> 01:57:23.000
Then we go to bed early, okay?

01:57:23.791 --> 01:57:25.125
It's the weekend, Mom.

01:57:25.166 --> 01:57:26.791
Why do I have to sleep early?

01:57:26.833 --> 01:57:28.166
I want to watch TV.

01:57:35.381 --> 01:57:36.714
Ah, dad's home!

01:57:37.250 --> 01:57:38.750
Dad, come eat with me.

01:57:39.250 --> 01:57:41.875
- Eat up, son.
- Why are you home so late today?

01:57:42.208 --> 01:57:43.583
There's some work at school.

01:57:44.125 --> 01:57:46.750
The department sent me to
an inter-department meeting in Da Nang.

01:57:47.041 --> 01:57:49.602
So I'm leaving on the 8 P.M bus.

01:57:50.333 --> 01:57:51.708
You two have dinner.

01:57:52.958 --> 01:57:55.416
But you promised to cut my hair.

01:57:55.993 --> 01:57:57.493
It's so itchy.

01:57:57.636 --> 01:58:00.136
Finish eating, then I'll cut your hair.

01:58:00.327 --> 01:58:01.110
Okay?

01:58:18.192 --> 01:58:20.109
What are you doing after
getting your hair cut?

01:58:20.871 --> 01:58:22.704
Mom told me to go to bed early.

01:58:23.083 --> 01:58:25.500
But before going to bed, I will study.

01:58:29.333 --> 01:58:32.583
When you are back, let's go camping papa.

01:58:36.041 --> 01:58:37.500
When I'm not home,

01:58:37.583 --> 01:58:39.541
you still have to remember to study.

01:58:39.958 --> 01:58:41.125
Yes, dad.

01:58:45.791 --> 01:58:48.291
But why do you have to leave so suddenly?

01:58:48.500 --> 01:58:50.583
Why don't you leave early tomorrow morning?

01:58:51.416 --> 01:58:52.833
If I leave tomorrow morning

01:58:52.986 --> 01:58:54.402
and the bus broke down,

01:58:54.458 --> 01:58:55.750
then my hands are tied.

01:58:57.750 --> 01:58:59.583
Oh, dad asked
what color you wanted to

01:58:59.625 --> 01:59:02.250
whitewash the house,
so he could prepare it.

01:59:06.750 --> 01:59:07.875
You choose.

01:59:09.791 --> 01:59:11.166
I trust your decision.

01:59:13.666 --> 01:59:14.791
Where is Su?

01:59:22.833 --> 01:59:24.000
Papa!

01:59:27.625 --> 01:59:29.166
Be good at home.

01:59:29.791 --> 01:59:30.833
Okay.

01:59:34.291 --> 01:59:35.375
I'm leaving now.

02:00:42.625 --> 02:00:43.791
3 A.M,

02:00:44.791 --> 02:00:46.750
I'll wait for you
at the Cay Coc t-junction.

02:00:49.750 --> 02:00:51.958
We will take the earliest bus
back to Lam Dong.

02:01:06.456 --> 02:01:07.623
What about Vinh?

02:01:08.137 --> 02:01:09.512
What about Vinh?

02:01:10.500 --> 02:01:12.083
Vinh will be okay.

02:01:15.541 --> 02:01:17.791
He will have the opportunity
to find new happiness.

02:01:21.958 --> 02:01:24.375
As for us, we don't have
any more chances, Mien.

02:01:28.786 --> 02:01:31.806
This feeling... Just like before.

02:01:32.333 --> 02:01:34.291
When I accidentally saw Mien holding

02:01:34.416 --> 02:01:36.569
the book "The Lady of the Camellias"
in her hand.

02:01:37.083 --> 02:01:38.375
And after that,

02:01:38.958 --> 02:01:40.500
Phuc told me the truth.

02:01:43.166 --> 02:01:44.416
Maybe

02:01:44.583 --> 02:01:46.250
this is God's intention

02:01:47.216 --> 02:01:49.716
that I learned the story
directly from Phuc,

02:01:50.130 --> 02:01:51.588
not from anyone else.

02:01:57.375 --> 02:01:59.541
What would people do in that situation?

02:02:00.916 --> 02:02:04.208
Would it be right to confront love?

02:02:05.233 --> 02:02:07.566
Or degrade love? Destroy it?

02:02:18.916 --> 02:02:20.791
Beyond anger,

02:02:22.217 --> 02:02:23.884
I felt sorry for Phuc.

02:02:25.958 --> 02:02:27.708
I just want to let Mien choose

02:02:28.000 --> 02:02:29.458
what really makes her happy.

02:02:50.708 --> 02:02:54.916
I am not sure if time is going past
too fast or too slowly.

02:02:55.458 --> 02:02:57.333
I need more time to think
and at the same time,

02:02:57.625 --> 02:03:00.083
I just want everything to happen
as quickly as possible.

02:03:02.041 --> 02:03:04.458
I know no matter what,

02:03:06.083 --> 02:03:09.625
we will all be in pain
for the rest of our lives.

02:03:13.831 --> 02:03:16.331
Even though I know clearly the reason
for my leaving this time.

02:03:17.833 --> 02:03:19.125
I even know where I am heading...

02:03:20.625 --> 02:03:22.791
but why does it still feel like an escape?

02:03:26.166 --> 02:03:27.833
I'm just trying to think

02:03:29.083 --> 02:03:30.250
baby Su...

02:03:31.333 --> 02:03:32.625
What does he need?

02:03:33.583 --> 02:03:35.041
From the moment he was born,

02:03:35.083 --> 02:03:36.541
he already lost so much.

02:03:37.583 --> 02:03:38.875
The right to have a mom,

02:03:39.833 --> 02:03:41.291
the right to see a dad.

02:03:44.458 --> 02:03:45.916
I tried to think about Mien.

02:03:46.958 --> 02:03:48.083
And Su.

02:03:50.291 --> 02:03:51.708
I will make it up to them.

02:03:52.250 --> 02:03:55.875
Becoming a husband and a father, something
I should have done all these years.

02:03:59.791 --> 02:04:01.625
Will my son grow up
with gratitude and in love

02:04:02.416 --> 02:04:04.958
or will he be consumed with hatred

02:04:05.708 --> 02:04:07.083
and bitterness later in his life?

02:04:15.583 --> 02:04:19.041
But why has Mien's question been echoing
in my head since I talked to her...

02:04:21.083 --> 02:04:22.416
What about Vinh?

02:04:25.541 --> 02:04:27.041
Do you want to be her husband?

02:04:27.583 --> 02:04:30.166
Do you think you will marry her?

02:04:30.500 --> 02:04:33.541
Then the two of you have children together,

02:04:34.333 --> 02:04:36.916
every time it's time to eat,
your kid will go

02:04:37.791 --> 02:04:40.666
"Dad, dad, come eat, dad!".

02:04:41.041 --> 02:04:42.958
- There!
- Hey!

02:04:43.791 --> 02:04:47.375
Why do you want me to
tell Mien that I like her?

02:04:49.000 --> 02:04:50.500
Because you and I are friends.

02:04:50.958 --> 02:04:52.541
I want to see you happy.

02:05:36.625 --> 02:05:38.000
I always think...

02:05:38.666 --> 02:05:42.291
Sacrifice is a noble quality of love.

02:05:42.916 --> 02:05:44.625
However,

02:05:45.166 --> 02:05:47.458
one can sacrifice everything for love,

02:05:48.583 --> 02:05:50.083
except the person they love.

02:06:01.500 --> 02:06:02.541
Hey, miss!

02:06:02.625 --> 02:06:03.679
Miss!

02:06:03.750 --> 02:06:05.166
Give me a ticket to Ha Lam.

02:06:05.375 --> 02:06:06.583
Leaving now, please.

02:07:22.911 --> 02:07:24.161
Papa Vinh!

02:08:24.940 --> 02:08:37.232
ONCE UPON A LOVE STORY

02:09:42.666 --> 02:09:44.125
I'm Su, papa Vinh's son.

02:09:44.708 --> 02:09:46.375
He came home in the morning,

02:09:46.407 --> 02:09:48.532
waiting for all hell to break lose,

02:09:48.916 --> 02:09:50.625
he was surprised to learn that

02:09:50.666 --> 02:09:53.666
he just stepped through heaven's door.

02:09:54.500 --> 02:09:58.833
I distinctively remember that
it was a Sunday morning, 20 years ago.

02:10:00.583 --> 02:10:04.083
Thank you. The readers are guessing that

02:10:04.108 --> 02:10:08.150
this latest novel is the true story
of your parents.

02:10:08.250 --> 02:10:10.333
What do you think about this statement?

02:10:11.958 --> 02:10:14.675
I think that to say this is a true story

02:10:14.958 --> 02:10:17.541
seems unfair to the readers.

02:10:19.139 --> 02:10:21.348
However, to say this is
purely fictional work

02:10:21.401 --> 02:10:23.817
is unfair for me.

02:10:25.916 --> 02:10:28.041
Beyond truth or fiction,

02:10:28.166 --> 02:10:30.291
the thing that kept me up
while writing this book was

02:10:30.500 --> 02:10:31.708
whether the readers

02:10:31.791 --> 02:10:33.833
would feel soothed and comforted,

02:10:34.016 --> 02:10:35.757
would they still think love is beautiful,

02:10:36.166 --> 02:10:38.416
or would they lose hope,

02:10:38.681 --> 02:10:39.764
would hate,

02:10:39.833 --> 02:10:41.333
and resent love.

02:10:43.166 --> 02:10:46.657
Beside love, this is also a story
about friendship,

02:10:46.791 --> 02:10:48.000
maturity,

02:10:48.083 --> 02:10:49.208
and loss.

02:10:50.541 --> 02:10:52.000
And all of those things

02:10:52.101 --> 02:10:53.851
are truer than anything else,

02:10:54.364 --> 02:10:55.447
wouldn't you agree?
